From: Roger.Bivand at nhh.no (Roger Bivand)
Date: Sat, 11 Jun 2011 00:14:27 +0200 (CEST)
Subject: [Rspatial-devel] Need to release sp
Message-ID: <alpine.LRH.2.00.1106110011570.32024@reclus.nhh.no>

Hi,

I located and resolved the rgeos gUnionCascaded() buffer overflow to C 
code exported by sp. The fix is to measure the length of the buffer and 
allocate with R_alloc() instead of just BUFSIZ. I need to release sp so 
that the fix can be applied in rgeos.

Best wishes,

Roger

